### Account Endpoints
### Run Login in auth.http first to get the access token

# ─── Create Account ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# @name createAccount
POST http://{{host}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "label": "Main Account"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("accountId", response.body.id);
  client.global.set("accountNumber", response.body.accountNumber);
%}

### ─── Create Second Account ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

# @name createSecondAccount
POST http://{{host}}/api/accounts
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "label": "Savings Account"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("toAccountNumber", response.body.accountNumber);
%}

### ─── Get Account by ID ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/{{accountId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ─── Get All Accounts for User ─────────────────────────────────────────────

GET http://{{host}}/api/accounts/user/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
